{{also|Wehren}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|weren}}, from {{inh|de|goh|werien}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*warjan}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*warjaną}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|[veːɐ̯n]|[ˈveːʁən]}}
* {{audio|de|De-wehren.ogg}}
* {{rhymes|de|eːʀən|s=2}}
* {{hyphenation|de|weh|ren}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb}}

# {{lb|de|reflexive}} to [[defend]] oneself {{+obj|de|:gegen(acc)<against someone/something>}}
#: {{uxi|de|Ich wollte mich doch nur '''wehren'''.|I only tried to '''defend''' myself.}}
#: {{coi|de|sich gegen Vorwürfe '''wehren'''|to '''defend''' oneself against accusations}}
# {{lb|de|archaic}} to [[prevent]] the spread of something, to [[fight]] {{+obj|de|dative}}
#: {{uxa|de|'''Wehret''' den Anfängen!|Do not let it take hold! / Nip it in the bud!|lit='''Fight''' the beginnings!}}
#: {{syn|de|bekämpfen}}
# {{lb|de|obsolete|transitive}} to [[deny]], to [[prevent]] someone from doing something
#: {{syn|de|verwehren}}

